        "id": 1006192
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-02-25T14:37:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is incorrect, it should be `refs/for/\u003cref\u003e`.\n\n\n\n```suggestion\n    pushHead(testRepo, \"refs/for/refs/heads/\" + testBranch);\n```",
      "range": {
